      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Event type: a meeting template in cal.com, e.g. \"30 min intro\"\nSlot: a start time cal.com says is free\nTool call: the model asks our code to run a named function\nWebhook: cal.com calls our server when a booking changes\nOAuth: user signs in with cal.com; no pasted API key",
