      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Card shape: {change_id, kind, title, attendee, old_start, new_start}, local time\nTime taken? The closest open time comes back as a ready Book card + 2-3 time chips\nContacts: ranked by how often the founder books them, read from cal.com history (nothing stored)\nVoice: the browser's own speech recognition (Web Speech API); hidden where unsupported\nSecrets from env: LIVEX_OPENROUTER_API_KEY, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, CAL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
